{
  "description": "How the coarse tier splits between decode, graph construction, inference and assembly, and what each of the 34 models costs. Built for phaze-8ifq8.",
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Where the coarse tier goes -- phaze-8ifq8's first question",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "THE panel this dashboard exists for. phaze-8ifq8 asks how the coarse tier splits between decode, graph construction, inference and assembly; before this epic that question needed hand-querying Postgres and reading pod log timestamps. Stacked because the interesting reading is the SHARE, and the values are concurrent work-seconds per wall-second -- above 1 means several analyses are running at once.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_chunk_decode_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\", tier=\"coarse\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "chunk decode",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_graph_build_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "graph construction",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_inference_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "inference proper",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_chunk_derive_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\", tier=\"coarse\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "derive + assemble",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Coarse tier: seconds of work per second of wall clock, by phase",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Per-model cost by classifier_type -- phaze-8ifq8's second question",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "34 models: 11 characteristic sets x 3 variants, plus the genre model. musicnn, vggish and effnet_discogs do not cost the same, and this is where that becomes a number rather than a belief. The WINDOW is not a label here -- it would be unbounded across a corpus whose longest file has 241 coarse windows -- so this is the mean over every window the range covers.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_inference_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (model_name, model_variant, classifier_type) / sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_inference_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (model_name, model_variant, classifier_type)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{model_name}} / {{model_variant}} ({{classifier_type}})",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Mean inference per window, by model",
      "type": "barchart"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Where the sweep's wall clock actually lands, aggregated to the three inference families.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 12
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (classifier_type) (rate(phaze_analysis_model_inference_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{classifier_type}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Total inference time by classifier_type",
      "type": "piechart"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 6,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "What the D-07 chunking costs",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "D-07 chunking pays 34 graph constructions per CHUNK instead of per file -- the deliberate price for a peak that does not scale with duration. This is that price, next to the work it protects.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_graph_build_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "graph build",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_graph_release_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "graph release",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_model_inference_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "inference",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Graph construction vs inference",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "phaze-zaf2l measured 5.31% fine / 94.69% coarse on one production run by differencing log timestamps. This is the same split, continuously and without reading a pod log.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_tier_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (tier)",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{tier}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fine vs coarse tier",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "MonoLoader cannot seek, so every chunk decodes from byte 0 up to its own gate. This is what that costs.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(phaze_analysis_chunk_decode_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, tier))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{tier}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_chunk_decode_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (tier) / sum(rate(phaze_analysis_chunk_decode_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (tier)",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "mean {{tier}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Chunk decode duration",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "The fine tier's counterpart to a model sweep. phaze-zaf2l measured 2.379-2.694 s per fine window on four of five production files and a 5.845 s outlier it could not explain from the database, because `metadata` stores no sample rate. This panel is where that outlier becomes visible while it happens.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 33
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(phaze_analysis_fine_window_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(phaze_analysis_fine_window_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(phaze_analysis_fine_window_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "mean",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fine window measurement (RhythmExtractor2013 + KeyExtractor)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": [
    "phaze",
    "analysis",
    "cost"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "datasource",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": {},
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(phaze_analysis_run_duration_seconds_count, job)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Service",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "job",
        "options": [],
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(phaze_analysis_run_duration_seconds_count, job)",
          "refId": "job"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "phaze / Analysis cost breakdown",
  "uid": "phaze-analysis-cost",
  "version": 0
}
